# WI-15: an internal error in the tool is one line naming the tool and the
# place in its source, exit status 4, and nothing else.
# COBALTC_TEST_INTERNAL_ERROR makes the tool report one on purpose.
file p.cb
fn main()
{
}
end
run env COBALTC_TEST_INTERNAL_ERROR=1 $COBC p.cb
status 4
stderr-lines 1
stderr-starts internal error in cobc: COBALTC_TEST_INTERNAL_ERROR is set (
stderr-ends ); please report it with the program\n
stderr-lacks panicked
